        "title": "HC Case Type Master API",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "description": "API provides list of the Case Types (referred as type_name) and relevant Case Type Codes (referred as case_type) used in the establishment for further accessing relevant APIs. Input for this API is Establishment Code and other details. Type Name and Case Type retrieved using this API can be used to access the case data using various Case Search APIs like Search by Case Registration Number, Filing Number etc."
